lection. Available with quilted sides upholstered in ‘Ripley’, ‘Ultrasound’ or ‘Perkins’ motifs.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"view-mode-full field field--name-field-spaces field--type-entity-reference field--label-above\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"view-mode-full field field--name-field-spaces field--type-entity-reference field--label-above\"><br></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"view-mode-full field field--name-field-spaces field--type-entity-reference field--label-above\"><br></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"view-mode-full field field--name-field-spaces field--type-entity-reference field--label-above\"><br></div>\n<br><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"view-mode-full field field--name-field-spaces field--type-entity-reference field--label-above\"><br></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"view-mode-full field field--name-field-spaces field--type-entity-reference field--label-above\"><br></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"view-mode-full field field--name-field-spaces field--type-entity-reference field--label-above\"><br></div>\n</div>\n<br>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"product-detail__column product-detail__column--image u-background--light-grey\">\n<div class=\"product-detail__image-item u-visible-up--md\"><br></div>\n</div>"
